  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Property includes dedicated Rosemary Beach® community Beach Access via 9 Private Beach Walkovers. Beach chair service available for an additional cost through RBPOA Beach Service. Complimentary access to Rosemary Beach® Fitness and complimentary court time at Rosemary Beach® Racquet Club also included.<br><br>Welcome to La Maison Rosemary <br>Nestled in the heart of the coveted Rosemary Beach community, La Maison Rosemary offers the ideal blend of luxury, comfort, and location. Situated on the north side of 30A, this beautifully designed home is just a 5-minute stroll to the sugar-white sands of the Emerald Coast and within walking distance to the community's four pools, fitness center, tennis courts, shops, and award-winning dining.<br><br>Property Highlights:<br>Prime location – walk to beach, pools, dining, and shopping<br>4 adult bikes included for exploring the scenic area<br>Peaceful front porch sitting and second-floor outdoor decks<br>Private patio with a gas grill, relaxing fountain, outdoor shower, and towel hooks<br>The Home:<br>First Floor:<br>An open-concept living area welcomes you with comfortable sofas and armchairs—perfect for relaxing after a day at the beach. The gourmet kitchen features stainless appliances, a Wolf range, and ample space for cooking and gathering. The dining table seats 8, with additional counter seating. This floor also includes a king bedroom with a private en-suite bath, a convenient powder room, and a full laundry room.<br><br>Second Floor:<br>The grand master suite boasts a king bed, a sleeper sofa with a gel mattress, a spacious en-suite bath, and private access to the deck. A second master suite includes a full bath and deck access. An additional queen bedroom with its own bathroom completes this level—all bedrooms open to relaxing porches perfect for your morning coffee or evening glass of wine.<br><br>Third Floor:<br>Designed with kids or large families in mind, the top floor features a fun and functional loft-style bunk room with two sets of bunk beds and a full bathroom. An additional bunk room offers two more sets of bunk beds, making this space ideal for children or groups.<br>Whether you're seeking a peaceful beach escape or a lively family adventure, La Maison 30A at Rosemary Beach offers everything you need for an unforgettable vacation. Book your stay today and experience the charm, elegance, and relaxation that make Rosemary Beach one of the most sought-after destinations on 30A.<br><br>**PROPERTY REQUIRES A 7 NIGHT MINIMUM SATURDAY TO SATURDAY DURING SPRING BREAK & SUMMER",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "La Maison Rosemary - Access to private beach, 4 community pools, and 4 free bikes!"
        }
      ],
